            "textSha256": "101a858ff51818348b2186921408c748e11d2b63cbf48212d790be26b1e490b9"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "After landing at Bariloche Airport, you will meet your driver for a private transfer to the Lakeshore Chalet.\n Settle into one of Bariloche’s most beautiful homes, located directly on Lake Nahuel Huapi with its own private dock and sandy beach.\n Enjoy a relaxed welcome dinner prepared with fresh local ingredients while admiring sunset views over the lake and mountains."
    },
